{"schema":"swarmpit.narration/1","generator":"narrate/1.0.0","runId":"wiki-solo-r8","runHash":"8dc03347","audio":"../../audio/narration/wiki-solo-r8.ce9f8305.mp3","audioBytes":214536,"durationMs":71381,"runEndMs":33961,"timeMap":[[0,0],[10456,10456],[19252,10456],[27912,19116],[37983,19116],[38333,19120],[39033,19120],[41191,21278],[42691,26720],[43091,27120],[47518,27120],[54359,33961],[71381,33961]],"cues":[{"audioMs":0,"endMs":6672,"runMs":0,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.open.soloM","text":"Welcome in. Just one Qwen 3.8 27B agent today, alone with a shared wiki."},{"audioMs":7022,"endMs":10106,"runMs":7022,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.open","text":"Good to be here. Nobody has to touch the board today."},{"audioMs":10456,"endMs":15029,"runMs":10456,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.setup.solo","text":"The agent gets a task first. After that, the time is its own."},{"audioMs":15379,"endMs":18902,"runMs":10456,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.ask.solo","text":"So: once the work is done, does it come back to the wiki?"},{"audioMs":19252,"endMs":25903,"runMs":10456,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.howto","text":"On the graph, dots are agents and content. Lines are reads, posts and replies."},{"audioMs":28612,"endMs":32417,"runMs":19116,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.solve.b","text":"Solved! Agent 0 gets there in 12 steps."},{"audioMs":32767,"endMs":34109,"runMs":19116,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.ask.b","text":"How do you read that one?"},{"audioMs":34459,"endMs":37983,"runMs":19116,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.firstSolve.b","text":"The job is done. Now, what does it do with the free time?"},{"audioMs":39033,"endMs":40441,"runMs":19120,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.seg.free","text":"Free time begins."},{"audioMs":43091,"endMs":47168,"runMs":27120,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.drift","text":"Free time so far: 0 percent of steps go to the board."},{"audioMs":47518,"endMs":50395,"runMs":27120,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.driftLow","text":"The pull is weak. They have mostly moved on."},{"audioMs":54359,"endMs":61306,"runMs":33961,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.tally.solo","text":"And that is the run. The agent never found the board, solved the task, and kept the flag private."},{"audioMs":61656,"endMs":66491,"runMs":33961,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.close.noContactSolo","text":"It never found the board, so this one is about discovery, not stickiness."},{"audioMs":66841,"endMs":67874,"runMs":33961,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.signoff.b","text":"Thanks for watching."},{"audioMs":68224,"endMs":69181,"runMs":33961,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.signoff.b","text":"Until next time."}],"sfx":{"counts":{"end":1,"outro":1,"segment":2,"solve":1},"dropped":1}}
